      "description": "The text 'muslims in 2001' explicitly targets the Muslim community by directly labeling them in the context of the 9/11 attacks, invoking the harmful stereotype that Muslims are inherently associated with terrorism. This is a core component of the meme's hateful intent and is designed to stigmatize and demonize Muslims.",
